{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27918","headline":"和刘补阙秋园寓兴之什十首 八 · 朱庆余","name":"和刘补阙秋园寓兴之什十首 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卷帘天色静，近濑觉衣单。\n蕉叶犹停翠，桐阴已爽寒。\n云从高处望，琴爱静时弹。\n正去重阳近，吟秋意未阑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱庆余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27918.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27918","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}